# Swamp of Sorrows - Rares & Treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 5 shippable rares and the fixed world
# containers of the Swamp of Sorrows. Run it in its own Polestar tab at the end
# of the core route or standalone. EVERY goal is optional: a rare that is not
# up never holds the route. Spawn points and levels are the local Forever game
# data (questie-forever); signature drops are items whose SOLE dropper is the
# rare. Ordinary greens and generic multi-zone world drops get a note, not a
# goal. No tame lines ship (the data has no tameability flag and the core guide
# never mentions any of the 9 rare-flagged NPCs - see
# docs/companion-unverified.md). Respawn timers are unconfirmed anywhere, so
# none are stated. No rare in this guide is a giver, ender, or objective of any
# core-contracted quest. The 4 far-above-band rares (Wyrmak 45, Jade 47, Veyzhak
# 48, Zekkis 49) are excluded - see docs/swamp-of-sorrows-companions-inventory.md
# for the full inventory. Quest-owned containers (Caravan Chest, Galen's
# Strongbox and cage, draenethyst, driftwood, Soggy Scroll, Spectral Lockbox)
# live in swamp-of-sorrows.guide, which owns those quests; this guide never
# accepts or turns in.
guide butler-routes-completionist/swamp-of-sorrows-rares
title Swamp of Sorrows - Rares & Treasures
levels 30-38
zone Swamp of Sorrows
faction Alliance
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords swamp of sorrows, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

