  goto 37.28,36.97
  goto 38.23,39.75
  goto 39.71,36.04
  goto 41.15,31.64
  goto 43.27,33.96
  kill 14448 optional
  note Level 42 rare roaming the west; come back in the low 40s. Its drops are ordinary goods (no sole drop in the data), so there is nothing signature to chase.
  note It is also one of five in-zone droppers of the 11205 Advanced Herbalism formula - the recipes companion covers that hunt.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

